⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
389 calories 41g protein (for the entire pint, toppings/mix-ins included)

Netflix & Chill’d Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Full recipe book (170+ flavors) in bio!

- 400g Fat Free Fairlife Milk
- 40-45g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 8g (½ tbsp) Peanut Butter
- 16g (2 tbsp) PB Fit
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- 10g crushed up pretzels
- ½ of a Prime Bites Protein Brownie 
389 cal 26g C, 11g F, 41g P, 18g sugar, 4g fiber

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Top with pretzels and crumbled up brownie pieces

